A requirements review exposed two issues before finalization: the weathering contingency denominators must be artifact-level rather than repeated sampling-point level, and the report needs explicit reconstructed pre-weathering compositions rather than only paired deltas. I’m correcting those and replacing generic figure panels with plots derived directly from computed metrics.
